---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { LINKS } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="A bit about Dominic Harrington outside of engineering.">
  <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">About</h1>
  <div class="prose mt-8">
    <p>
      Engineering at Cambridge is the day job — this page is the rest. I&rsquo;m a member of St
      John&rsquo;s College, where I seem to have a habit of collecting roles: president of the
      Engineering Society in 2023/24, and captain of the college athletics team in 2024/25.
    </p>
    <p>
      Sport takes up most of the spare hours. During my year as athletics captain we won Cuppers —
      the college athletics league — and I finished 2nd in Cambridge in the 400m. Before that I was
      the college hockey team&rsquo;s top goal scorer, and further back still I sailed RS Fevas at
      the UK nationals.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every fortnight I help run the OMV Cambridge soup kitchen, and in 2022 I spent a week
      volunteering in a hospital in Lourdes. In July 2025 I swapped Cambridge for Japan for a
      while, on exchange at Nagoya University.
    </p>
    <p>
      If any of this — or the <a href="/projects/">work</a> — is worth a conversation, my inbox is
      open: <a href={`mailto:${LINKS.email}`}>{LINKS.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
